    <h1>Currency Conversion for Pricebooks</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-colo=
r: #998DD9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<p>Fortra Review Complete 10.10.2025</p>
</div>
</div>
<p><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,200);">Bulk adding products=
 with automation - will discuss more in a meeting</span></p>
<p><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,200);">Updates to the table=
.. how will that update the pricebooks? - Update product price flow?</span>=
The currency table itself has been implemented as a custom metadata type. &=
nbsp;This provide you a table (like a typically SF object) to simply update=
 the values. &nbsp;I can demo this to you next week.</p>
<h1 id=3D"CurrencyConversionforPricebooks-PricebookCurrencyConversions:">Pr=
icebook Currency Conversions:</h1>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Fortra Annual Review will be done by finance and will be utilized for th=
is and ARR for compensation. With option of some quarterly to adjust.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>Using the rates below not current Exchange rates.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Round up to the nearest $5.</p></li>
</ul>
